<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>Rural Homestay Guide</title>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <style>
      body { font-family: sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 40px auto; padding: 20px; line-height: 1.6; }
      .card { border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 15px; display: block; text-decoration: none; color: #333; }
      .card:hover { border-color: #0b6623; background-color: #f9fbf9; }
      h1 { color: #0b6623; }
      h2 { margin-top: 30px; font-size: 1.2rem; color: #555; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <h1>Open Source Rural Homestay Guide</h1>
    <p>A practical handbook empowering rural communities to build sustainable, economically viable homestays on their own terms.</p>

    <h2>1. Operational Guides</h2>

    <a href="/readiness" class="card">
      <strong>📋 Village Readiness Checklist</strong>
      <p>Assess if your home and village are prepared for guests.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/culture" class="card">
      <strong>🌿 Cultural & Environmental Rules</strong>
      <p>Protect local heritage, set photography boundaries, and manage waste.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/digital-setup" class="card">
      <strong>📱 Zero-Cost Digital Setup</strong>
      <p>Set up Google Maps, WhatsApp Business, and direct UPI payments.</p>
    </a>

    <h2>2. Interactive Tools</h2>

    <a href="/calculator" class="card">
      <strong>🧮 Pricing Calculator</strong>
      <p>Calculate fair nightly rates, meal costs, and community fund shares.</p>
    </a>
  </body>
</html>
